<%
box = infobox.InfoBox()
box.title = 'Download Ogg Vorbis Software for Mac OS 9 and Mac OS X'
box.fontsize = -1
box.title_image = '/images/NewsBox-bg.png'
box.title_image_r = '/images/NewsBox-right-bg.png'

self.write(box.start())
%>

<h2>1.0 developer kit</h2>
Includes HTML docs, includes, shared libraries, and vorbis example source
<blockquote>
<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0/macos/oggvorbis-macos-libs-1.0.sit">SDK for MacOS9</a><br>
<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0/macos/oggvorbis-macosx-libs-1.0.tar.gz">SDK for MacOSX</a><br>
</blockquote>

<h2>Players</h2>
<i>These players are currently known to use use older Ogg releases.  We'll post any updates we become aware of.</y>
<blockquote>
<a href="http://www.panic.com/audion/">Audion 3</a><br>
<a href="http://www.unsanity.com/echo.html">Unsanity Echo</a><br>
<a href="http://www.subband.com/macamp/">MacAMP</a><br>
</blockquote>

<h2>Encoders</h2>
<i>These encoders are currently known to use use older Ogg releases.  We'll post any updates we become aware of.</y>
<blockquote>
<a href="http://www.proteron.com/n2mp3pro/">N2MP3 Pro</a><br>
<a href="http://www.macdvd.org/DropOgg/">DropOgg</a><br>
<a href="http://www.nouturn.com/oggdrop/index.html">OggDrop</a> for MacOS 9 and MacOS X<br>
</blockquote>

<br>

<b>You can find more Macintosh software on our <a href="/software.psp">third party software page</a>.</b>

<%
self.write(box.finish())
%>

